ng time by 20%\' instead of just listing duties).\"]', 'Automated check only — for detailed formatting feedback (layout, spacing, section order), AI screening needs to be configured by an administrator.', '[\"Use standard section headings like \\\"Experience\\\", \\\"Education\\\", and \\\"Skills\\\" so ATS software can parse them correctly.\",\"Avoid tables, columns, or text boxes for key content \\u2014 some ATS parsers cannot read them.\",\"Save and submit as a text-based PDF, not a scanned image.\"]', '2026-09-03 16:52:16'),
