chnical project description detailing a modern tech stack, including Laravel, Firestore, and Gemini API integration.\",\"Excellent academic performance with clear, competitive CGPAs listed for both your Diploma and Bachelor\'s degrees.\",\"Possession of valuable professional certifications (Google Project Management, DevSecOps) that demonstrate continuous learning.\"]', '[\"Reorganize the resume structure to follow a standard flow: Contact Info, Summary, Education, Technical Skills, Work Experience, Projects, and Extracurriculars.\",\"Quantify your achievements in your work experience, such as stating by what percentage you surpassed sales targets or how many users you supported during your internship.\",\"Remove the \'References\' section entirely, as modern resumes do not require them and they occupy valuable space that could be used for more project details.\",\"Fix formatting and spacing issues, such as the merged text in your education dates and the inconsistent capitalization in your extracurricular activities.\"]', 'The current layout places your contact information in the middle of the document rather than at the very top, which is highly non-standard. Ensure your name and contact details are the first things a reader sees, followed by a logical top-to-bottom flow.', '[\"Place your contact information at the very top of the document so ATS parsers can easily identify your name and contact details.\",\"Use standard, simple section headers like \'Work Experience\' and \'Education\' instead of combined or stylized headers.\",\"Avoid mixing dates directly into the company or school names without spaces (e.g., \'March 2021-October 2023KOLEJ...\'), as this can cause parsing errors in ATS databases.\"]', '2026-09-03 16:54:11'),
