commendations.\nMaximized high foot traffic in a fast-paced festival setting to actively engage potential buyers and\ngenerate promotional sales.\nJul 2024 - Oct 2024Retail Assistant, ZTE Mobile \nAdvised customers through product selections by leveraging expert-level knowledge of mobile\ndevices, consistently surpassing sales targets.\nProcessed efficient sales transactions, addressed customer inquiries, and accelerated overall store\nrevenue growth.\nCoordinated store visual merchandising standards and streamlined inventory management to ensure\noptimal product availability.\nAug 2023 - Jan 2024System Engineering Intern, Bastion Solution Sdn Bhd | Intern \nAdministered and optimized the government DDMS 2.0 system, ensuring high availability and\nseamless daily operations for end-users.\nExecuted continuous server monitoring to identify and proactively mitigate potential technical\ndisruptions.\nTroubleshot and resolved user-reported technical issues efficiently, providing vital support and\nelevating overall system satisfaction.\nREFERENCES INDUSTRIAL LINKAGES (IL)\nTs.Nurdatillah Hasim\n[REDACTED EMAIL] \n(+60)17-5636371 \nNoor Suzieany Binti M Radzali\n[REDACTED EMAIL] \n(+60)12-3664184\nLEADERSHIP & EXTRACURRICULAR ACTIVITIES\nLeader Team, TECHNOPRENEURSHIP \nTreasurer, Phantom Runners Club (PRC)\nMember, CREATIVE MULTIMEDIA CLUB\nMember, NETBALL CLUB\nMember, UniKL MIIT NETSYS CLUB\nParticipate Efootball Unikl E-Sport Carnival (UESC) 2025\nProfessional & Student Organizations\nRunner, Half Marathoner\nSports', '72', 'Good', 'You have a very strong technical foundation with impressive projects (like the Attendance Tracking System) and relevant internship experience at Bastion Solution. However, the current layout of your resume is causing text to merge and sections to appear out of order, which will severely hurt your chances with ATS parsers. By restructuring your document into a clean, single-column format and adding quantified achievements, you can significantly elevate its impact.', '[\"Excellent technical project description detailing a modern stack (Laravel, Firestore, Gemini API) and clear responsibilities.\",\"Strong academic background with solid CGPAs (3.62 and 3.31) and highly relevant certifications (Google Project Management, DevSecOps).\",\"Relevant professional experience, particularly the System Engineering Internship, which aligns well with your IT career goals.\"]', '[\"Quantify your achievements in both your work experience and projects (e.g., state by what percentage you surpassed sales targets or how many users the attendance system supported).\",\"Fix the reading order and text merging issues (e.g., \'2023KOLEJ\', \'SUHAIMINSemarak\') by avoiding complex multi-column layouts or text boxes.\",\"Move your contact information and name to the very top of the resume, before the Education and Summary sections.\",\"Remove the \'References\' section to save valuable space, as references are typically requested later in the hiring process.\"]', 'The raw text extraction shows that your name and contact details are sandwiched in the middle of the document, and several words are merged together. Use a standard, single-column layout with clear, bold section headers to ensure ATS and human recruiters can read it chronologically.', '[\"Ensure your name, email, phone, and LinkedIn are the absolute first things on the page so the ATS parses your contact details correctly.\",\"Avoid using tables, columns, or graphic elements to separate text, as these often cause words to merge (like \'SERVICES&\' or \'SUHAIMINSemarak\') during parsing.\",\"Use standard section headers like \'Work Experience\' and \'Education\' instead of combining them or placing them in unconventional orders.\"]', '2026-09-03 16:56:34'),
