commendations.\nMaximized high foot traffic in a fast-paced festival setting to actively engage potential buyers and\ngenerate promotional sales.\nJul 2024 - Oct 2024Retail Assistant, ZTE Mobile \nAdvised customers through product selections by leveraging expert-level knowledge of mobile\ndevices, consistently surpassing sales targets.\nProcessed efficient sales transactions, addressed customer inquiries, and accelerated overall store\nrevenue growth.\nCoordinated store visual merchandising standards and streamlined inventory management to ensure\noptimal product availability.\nAug 2023 - Jan 2024System Engineering Intern, Bastion Solution Sdn Bhd | Intern \nAdministered and optimized the government DDMS 2.0 system, ensuring high availability and\nseamless daily operations for end-users.\nExecuted continuous server monitoring to identify and proactively mitigate potential technical\ndisruptions.\nTroubleshot and resolved user-reported technical issues efficiently, providing vital support and\nelevating overall system satisfaction.\nREFERENCES INDUSTRIAL LINKAGES (IL)\nTs.Nurdatillah Hasim\n[REDACTED EMAIL] \n(+60)17-5636371 \nNoor Suzieany Binti M Radzali\n[REDACTED EMAIL] \n(+60)12-3664184\nLEADERSHIP & EXTRACURRICULAR ACTIVITIES\nLeader Team, TECHNOPRENEURSHIP \nTreasurer, Phantom Runners Club (PRC)\nMember, CREATIVE MULTIMEDIA CLUB\nMember, NETBALL CLUB\nMember, UniKL MIIT NETSYS CLUB\nParticipate Efootball Unikl E-Sport Carnival (UESC) 2025\nProfessional & Student Organizations\nRunner, Half Marathoner\nSports', '74', 'Good', 'You have a solid technical foundation with an impressive full-stack project utilizing modern tech like Laravel and the Google Gemini API, alongside strong academic results. However, your most relevant technical internship is currently buried beneath non-technical retail and event promoter jobs. Elevating your tech experience, adding measurable metrics to your achievements, and removing references will make this resume significantly more competitive for software engineering roles.', '[\"Comprehensive project breakdown for the Attendance Tracking System with specific, high-demand technologies (Laravel, Firestore, Gemini API).\",\"Strong academic track record (3.62 Diploma \\/ 3.31 Degree CGPA) paired with relevant industry certifications like DevSecOps and Google Project Management.\",\"Well-categorized technical skill set that clearly outlines frameworks, databases, and methodologies.\"]', '[\"Reorganize your work experience to highlight your System Engineering Internship at Bastion Solution above non-technical retail\\/promoter roles.\",\"Quantify your achievements with hard metrics (e.g., number of users supported, ticket volume resolved, or uptime percentage maintained during your internship).\",\"Remove the References section entirely; employers will request them later in the hiring process, and removing them saves space for more technical depth.\",\"Add brief impact bullets under leadership roles instead of listing titles, showing how you contributed as Leader or Treasurer.\"]', 'Place your name and contact details at the very top of the page before the Summary, and ensure standard reverse-chronological ordering throughout.', '[\"Place your contact information strictly in the header rather than mid-document so ATS parsers correctly index your email, phone, and LinkedIn URL.\",\"Omit niche or irrelevant skills like \'Mobilegraphy\' from the technical skills section to keep keyword density focused on software engineering.\",\"Use standard heading titles such as \'Work Experience\' and \'Projects\' without combining them with other text.\"]', '2026-09-03 16:56:53'),
